{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef MI():\n    return map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n\nn, mod = MI()\nm = n * (n - 1) // 2\n\nstates = [dict() for _ in range(n + 1)]\nstates[1][(0, 1)] = 1\n\nfor i in range(1, n):\n    nxt = defaultdict(int)\n    for (j, k), val in states[i].items():\n        if not val:\n            continue\n        key1 = (j + i, i + 1)\n        nxt[key1] = (nxt[key1] + val) % mod\n        base = j + i - 1\n        for l in range(i):\n            key = (base - l, k)\n            nxt[key] = (nxt[key] + val) % mod\n    states[i + 1] = nxt\n\ndp = [[[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)] for __ in range(n + 1)]\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    for (j, k), val in states[i].items():\n        dp[i][j][k] = val\n\nS_dp = [[[0] * (m + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)] for __ in range(n + 1)]\nfor i in range(n + 1):\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        acc = 0\n        for j in range(m + 1):\n            acc += dp[i][j][k]\n            acc %= mod\n            S_dp[i][k][j] = acc\n\nSS_dp = [[[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)] for __ in range(n + 1)]\nfor i in range(n + 1):\n    for j in range(m + 1):\n        acc = 0\n        for k in range(n + 1):\n            acc += S_dp[i][k][j]\n            acc %= mod\n            SS_dp[i][j][k] = acc\n\nANS = [0] * (n + 1)\nfor i in range(1, n + 1):\n    ans = (i * ANS[i - 1]) % mod\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        for j in range(1, m + 1):\n            if not dp[i][j][k]:\n                continue\n            ans += dp[i][j][k] * (SS_dp[i][j - 1][-1] - SS_dp[i][j - 1][k])\n            ans %= mod\n    ANS[i] = ans\n\nprint(ANS[-1])\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\ntypedef long long ll;\n\nint main() {\n    int n, mod;\n    cin >> n >> mod;\n    int m = n * (n - 1) / 2;\n\n    // dp[i][j][k] for i=0..n, j=0..m, k=0..n\n    vector<vector<vector<ll>>> dp(n+1, vector<vector<ll>>(m+1, vector<ll>(n+1, 0)));\n    dp[1][0][1] = 1;\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 0; j <= m; ++j) {\n            for (int k = 0; k <= n; ++k) {\n                ll val = dp[i][j][k];\n                if (val == 0) continue;\n                // key1 = (j+i, i+1)\n                int nj1 = j + i;\n                int nk1 = i + 1;\n                if (nj1 <= m) {\n                    dp[i+1][nj1][nk1] = (dp[i+1][nj1][nk1] + val) % mod;\n                }\n                // base = j + i - 1\n                int base = j + i - 1;\n                for (int l = 0; l < i; ++l) {\n                    int nj2 = base - l;\n                    if (nj2 >= 0 && nj2 <= m) {\n                        dp[i+1][nj2][k] = (dp[i+1][nj2][k] + val) % mod;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // S_dp[i][k][j] = prefix sum over j of dp[i][j][k]\n    vector<vector<vector<ll>>> S_dp(n+1, vector<vector<ll>>(n+1, vector<ll>(m+1, 0)));\n    for (int i = 0; i <= n; ++i) {\n        for (int k = 0; k <= n; ++k) {\n            ll acc = 0;\n            for (int j = 0; j <= m; ++j) {\n                acc = (acc + dp[i][j][k]) % mod;\n                S_dp[i][k][j] = acc;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // SS_dp[i][j][k] = prefix sum over k of S_dp[i][k][j]\n    vector<vector<vector<ll>>> SS_dp(n+1, vector<vector<ll>>(m+1, vector<ll>(n+1, 0)));\n    for (int i = 0; i <= n; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 0; j <= m; ++j) {\n            ll acc = 0;\n            for (int k = 0; k <= n; ++k) {\n                acc = (acc + S_dp[i][k][j]) % mod;\n                SS_dp[i][j][k] = acc;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    vector<ll> ANS(n+1, 0);\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        ll ans = (i * ANS[i-1]) % mod;\n        for (int k = 0; k <= n; ++k) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= m; ++j) {\n                ll val = dp[i][j][k];\n                if (val == 0) continue;\n                ll diff = (SS_dp[i][j-1][n] - SS_dp[i][j-1][k]) % mod;\n                if (diff < 0) diff += mod;\n                ans = (ans + val * diff) % mod;\n            }\n        }\n        ANS[i] = ans;\n    }\n\n    cout << ANS[n] << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.3920811712741852, -5.340433563105762e-05, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0015905360924080014, -0.0003748429589904845, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.03827216848731041, -1.2993727978027891e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.01815464347600937, -0.38703373074531555, 0.0, -0.01831383816897869, -0.25202521681785583, -0.02337902970612049, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -0.01416979543864727, -0.0019296851241961122, 0.0, 0.0, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -5.090107151772827e-05, -6.437280717364047e-06, 0.0, -1.3470558769768104e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.810443589231e-05, -0.39652854204177856, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0298287533223629, -0.00043096792069263756, -3.266281055402942e-05, 0.0, -5.36440347786